;. /publish_grove_draft_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition publish_grove_draft
  ;= Publish an explicitly selected compiled revision
    The selected publication control must address the exact observed draft revision. Publication replaces the draft sample instance; it is not a migration of existing business data. Observe the resulting job through capture. Failed or stale publication remains visible in native work.

